==Finnish==

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}

# {{lb|fi|archaic|literary|crosswords}} {{alternative form of|tuntea|lang=fi|nodot=1}} ("to feel"; also "to get to feel", "to experience").
#: ''Olen elämässäni saanut '''tuta''' kaikenlaista, mutta tällaista raakuutta en ole ennen nähnyt.''
#:: I have '''experienced''' a lot during my lifetime, but I have never seen brutality like this.

====Conjugation====
Only used in first infinitive ('''''tuta''''', {{m|fi|tutaakseen}}), passive present indicative ({{m|fi|tutaan}}) and rarely in instructive of second active infinitive ({{m|fi|tutaen}}). The passive past participle ({{m|fi|tuttu}}) is in modern usage viewed simply as an adjective meaning "familiar", and the passive present participle ({{m|fi|tuttava}}) as a noun meaning "acquaintance".

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to feel}} [[tuntea]]
* {{sense|to experience}} [[kokea]]

